<span data-as="p">To use this SDK, initialize the <code>Credentials</code> class and create a new client. The <code>Credentials</code> class is JSON enabled. Ensure that INTX API credentials are stored in a secure manner.</span>
<span data-as="p">The JSON format expected for credentials is:</span>
<div class="code-block mt-5 mb-8 not-prose rounded-2xl relative group min-w-0 print:print-color-exact text-gray-950 dark:text-gray-50 codeblock-light border border-gray-950/10 dark:border-white/10 dark:twoslash-dark bg-transparent dark:bg-transparent" data-has-floating-buttons="" lines="true" wrap="true" numberOfLines="1" language="shellscript"><div data-floating-buttons="true" class="absolute top-3 right-4 flex items-center gap-1.5 print:hidden opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 group-focus-within:opacity-100"><div class="z-10 select-none" id="base-ui-_R_fal9b6qqnpfb39p7b9snpfiutb_" data-base-ui-tooltip-trigger=""><button class="size-6.5 flex items-center justify-center rounded-md group/code-snippet-feedback-button [.code-block:not(:has([data-fade-overlay]))_[data-floating-buttons]_&amp;]:bg-gray-100 dark:[.code-block:not(:has([data-fade-overlay]))_[data-floating-buttons]_&amp;]:bg-gray-800" id="code-snippet-feedback-button" aria-label="Report incorrect code"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 18 18" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" class="size-4 shrink-0 text-gray-400 group-hover/code-snippet-feedback-button:text-gray-500 dark:text-white/40 dark:group-hover/code-snippet-feedback-button:text-white/60"><path d="M9 5.431V9.569" stroke="currentColor" width="1.5" linecap="round" linejoin="round"></path><path d="M9 11.417C8.449 11.417 8 11.866 8 12.417C8 12.968 8.449 13.417 9 13.417C9.551 13.417 10 12.968 10 12.417C10 11.866 9.551 11.417 9 11.417Z" fill="currentColor" stroke="none"></path><path d="M10.968 2.25H7.03301C6.50301 2.25 5.99401 2.461 5.61901 2.836L2.83701 5.618C2.46201 5.993 2.25101 6.502 2.25101 7.032V10.967C2.25101 11.497 2.46201 12.006 2.83701 12.381L5.61901 15.163C5.99401 15.538 6.50301 15.749 7.03301 15.749H10.968C11.498 15.749 12.007 15.538 12.382 15.163L15.164 12.381C15.539 12.006 15.75 11.497 15.75 10.967V7.032C15.75 6.502 15.5