s and ERC-4337 user operations, no custom indexer required.\",\"href\":\"/data/sql-api/builder-codes\"},{\"title\":\"CoinbaSeQL Grammar\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"CoinbaSeQL Grammar\",\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/data/sql-api/sql\"},{\"title\":\"SQL API FAQ\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"FAQ\",\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/data/sql-api/faq\"},{\"title\":\"Best Practices\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Best Practices\",\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/data/sql-api/best-practices\"},{\"title\":\"REST API Reference\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"REST API Reference\",\"url\":\"/api-reference/v2/rest-api/sql-api/sql-api\",\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/data/sql-api/rest-apis\"}]},{\"group\":\"Token Balances\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Welcome to Token Balances API\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Overview\",\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/data/token-balance/welcome\"},{\"title\":\"Token Balances SDK\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"CDP SDK\",\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/data/token-balance/cdp-sdk\"},{\"title\":\"REST API Reference\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"REST API Reference\",\"url\":\"/api-reference/v2/rest-api/onchain-data/list-evm-token-balances\",\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/data/token-balance/cdp-api\"}]},{\"group\":\"Address History\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Address History\",\"description\":\"Query indexed transaction history and asset balances for any wallet address across supported blockchain networks.\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Overview\",\"href\":\"/data/address-history/overview\"},{\"title\":\"REST API Reference\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"REST API Reference\",\"url\":\"/api-reference/rest-api/addresses/get-address-transaction-history\",\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/data/address-history/cdp-rest-api\"},{\"title\":\"JSON-RPC Methods\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"JSON-RPC API Reference\",\"url\":\"/api-reference/json-rpc-api/address-history\",\"description\":null,\"href\":\"/data/address-history/json-rpc-methods\"}]}]},{\"group\":\"Faucet\",\"pages\":[{\"title\":\"Overview\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Overview\",\"description\":null,\"