ation for Coinbase Wallet\",\"href\":\"/coinbase-wallet/guides/sign-and-verify-typed-data\"},{\"title\":\"Batch Transactions\",\"description\":\"Send multiple onchain calls in a single Coinbase Wallet transaction to reduce multi-step flows to one click.\",\"href\":\"/coinbase-wallet/improve-ux/batch-transactions\"},{\"title\":\"Use Spend Permissions\",\"description\":\"Learn how to use Spend Permissions to allow a trusted spender to spend user assets\",\"href\":\"/coinbase-wallet/improve-ux/spend-permissions\"},{\"title\":\"Use Sub Accounts\",\"description\":\"Learn how to create and use Sub Accounts using Coinbase Wallet SDK\",\"href\":\"/coinbase-wallet/improve-ux/sub-accounts\"},{\"title\":\"Sponsor Gas\",\"description\":\"Use Paymasters to sponsor your users' transactions\",\"href\":\"/coinbase-wallet/improve-ux/sponsor-gas/paymasters\"},{\"title\":\"Pay Gas in ERC20 Tokens\",\"description\":\"Coinbase Wallet enables users to pay for gas in ERC20 tokens\",\"href\":\"/coinbase-wallet/improve-ux/sponsor-gas/erc20-paymasters\"},{\"title\":\"Migrate from @coinbase/wallet-sdk\",\"description\":\"Move from the legacy Coinbase Wallet SDK package to Base Account SDK, the current recommendation for Coinbase Wallet.\",\"href\":\"/coinbase-wallet/guides/migration-guide\"},{\"title\":\"Telemetry · Coinbase Wallet\",\"sidebarTitle\":\"Telemetry\",\"description\":\"Understanding Coinbase Wallet's anonymous telemetry system and how to configure it.\",\"href\":\"/coinbase-wallet/more/telemetry\"},{\"title\":\"Popup Tips\",\"description\":\"Practical tips for working with Coinbase Wallet popups, including reliable triggering and common pitfalls.\",\"href\":\"/coinbase-wallet/guides/tips/popup-tips\"},{\"title\":\"Transaction Simulation Data\",\"description\":\"Copy Coinbase Wallet transaction simulation request and response data to inspect it in a text editor.\",\"href\":\"/coinbase-wallet/guides/tips/inspect-txn-simulation\"}]},{\"group\":\"Framework Integrations\",\"pages\":[{